  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_016 (multimodal) achieves 0.526 validation accuracy, but no single-modality baselines have been tested. This experiment tests a RNA-only baseline with PCA encoding (same RNA encoder as config_016) to directly compare performance against the multimodal approach. It isolates the effect of modality choice and establishes a critical benchmark for evaluating whether multimodal integration provides incremental value. This addresses key uncertainty about the relative efficacy of multimodal vs single-modality approaches."
